sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Staff
  participant UI as UI (React)
  participant Cache as Local cache<br/>(mockStorage)
  participant Outbox as Outbox<br/>(syncQueue)
  participant Sync as SyncEngine
  participant SB as Supabase<br/>(anon client)
  participant PG as Postgres (RLS)

  Note over Staff,PG: Sign-in and hydrate
  Staff->>UI: sign in (username + password)
  UI->>SB: signInWithPassword (synthetic email)
  SB-->>UI: session (JWT, hospital from metadata)
  UI->>SB: hydrateFromSupabase()
  SB->>PG: SELECT * each table (RLS-scoped, paged 1000)
  PG-->>SB: this hospital's rows only
  SB-->>Cache: replaceDatabaseFromTables()

  Note over Staff,PG: Local-first write (works offline)
  Staff->>UI: edit record (e.g. vitals)
  UI->>Cache: write (instant)
  UI->>Outbox: enqueue OutboxChange
  UI-->>Staff: UI updates immediately

  Note over Outbox,PG: Background drain when online
  Sync->>Outbox: drainOutbox()
  loop each pending change
    alt versioned table (optimistic concurrency)
      Sync->>PG: update ... .eq('version', base)
      alt 0 rows matched (stale version)
        PG-->>Sync: conflict
        Sync->>PG: refetch latest row
        Sync->>UI: CONFLICT_EVENT (refresh from server)
      else applied
        PG-->>Sync: bumped version
        Sync->>Outbox: remove change
      end
    else append-only clinical table
      Sync->>PG: insert / upsert (last-write-wins)
      PG-->>Sync: ok
      Sync->>Outbox: remove change
    end
  end
  Sync-->>UI: OUTBOX_EVENT (sync-status chip updates)
